Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Forensic reconstruction for AI-agent security incidents (DFIR)
 AgentTrace is a local-first, zero-dependency digital forensics and incident
 response (DFIR) tool for AI agents and LLM applications. It ingests recorded
 evidence (OpenTelemetry GenAI spans, MCP logs, vector-store retrieval logs,
 OAuth records, egress logs, hash-chained audit logs), verifies integrity and
 chain of custody, reconstructs the causal attack chain, detects attack patterns
 mapped to MITRE ATLAS, and produces regulator/court-ready reports.
 .
 It installs the "agenttrace" command-line tool. Defensive, authorized use only.
